python
Usage: sh ~/tools/xexec -t ~/tools/python bin/python3 [ARGS]

A full carried cpython 3.12 -- a repl, a scripting language, a quick web server
(`python3 -m http.server 8000`), and the runtime behind sqlmap and impacket.
Its C extensions need a whole tree, so it is run through xexec's `-t` tree mode.

	python3 -c 'CODE'       run a one-liner
	python3 script.py       run a script
	python3 -m http.server 8000   serve the current dir (a lab web target)

See also: xexec, sqlmap, impacket, cc
